e. These events lead to Chuck accepting Tingalla as his new home. The course of the series has the group trying to get the vessel back in business as it was in the previous century while competing with a rival vessel, The River Queen. They also come to terms with resident bully, Theodore \"Tiny\" Maloney and his friends, Davo and Spider.</p>","updated":1548792344,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/28586"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/1185242","name":"Pirate Ships"}}}},{"score":0.51534736,"show":{"id":9282,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/9282/mtp-daily","name":"MTP Daily","type":"News","language":"English","genres":[],"status":"Ended","runtime":60,"averageRuntime":60,"premiered":"2015-09-28","ended":"2022-06-03","officialSite":"http://www.msnbc.com/mtp-daily","schedule":{"time":"13:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":74,"network":{"id":201,"name":"MS NOW","country":{"name":"United States","code":"US","timezone":"America/New_York"},"officialSite":"https://www.ms.now/live"},"webChannel":null,"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/32/81692.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/32/81692.jpg"},"summary":"<p><b>MTP Daily</b> is a public affairs program hosted by Chuck Todd that looks ahead to 2016 election and features the top newsmakers of the day as they analyze and break down the issues facing the U.S. and world leaders.</p>","updated":1701713485,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/9282"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/2703994","name":"Episode 110"}}}},{"score":0.50170153,"show":{"id":32616,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/32616/chuck-versus-the-webisodes","name":"Chuck Versus the Webisodes","type":"Scripted","language":"English","genres":["Action"],"status":